<div class="lm-hero"><div><p class="lm-eyebrow">THE LIGHTEK ECOSYSTEM</p><h1>Everything you need.<br><em>One connected<br>platform.</em></h1><p class="lm-lead">Your business. Your stories. Your community.<br>Build what comes next with Lightek.</p><div class="lm-hero-actions"><a class="lm-action" href="#services">Explore services ↘</a><% if (path = marketplace_optional_page_path(:about)) %><%= link_to "Meet the ecosystem →", path, class: "lm-textbutton" %><% end %></div></div><div class="lm-art"><div class="lm-art-top"><span>INDEPENDENCE, BY DESIGN</span><div class="lm-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><h2>Your platform.<br>In your hands.</h2><div class="lm-stack"><div>Your business <span>BUILD</span></div><div>Your content <span>CREATE</span></div><div>Your community <span>CONNECT</span></div></div></div></div>
<div class="lm-sectionhead" id="services"><div><p class="lm-eyebrow">POSSIBILITY STARTS HERE</p><h2>Find your next move.</h2></div><span class="lm-muted lm-small">Services that work together.</span></div>
<nav class="lm-filters" aria-label="Service categories"><%= link_to "All services", main_app.marketplace_path(anchor: "services"), class: (@category.nil? ? "is-active" : nil), aria: {current: @category.nil? ? "page" : nil} %><% DymondCatalog::MarketplaceListing.category_labels.each do |key, label| %><%= link_to label, main_app.marketplace_path(category: key, anchor: "services"), class: (@category == key ? "is-active" : nil), aria: {current: @category == key ? "page" : nil} %><% end %></nav>
<div class="lm-products"><% @listings.each do |listing| %><article class="lm-product"><%= render "marketplace/art", category: listing.category %><div class="lm-productbody"><span class="lm-tag"><%= DymondCatalog::MarketplaceListing.category_labels.fetch(listing.category) %></span><h3><%= listing.title %></h3><p><%= listing.summary %></p><div class="lm-productfooter"><span class="lm-price"><%= marketplace_rate(listing) %></span><%= link_to "Explore ↗", main_app.marketplace_listing_path(listing), class: "lm-action secondary small" %></div></div></article><% end %>
<% if @listings.empty? %><div class="lm-empty"><h3>Your next move starts here.</h3><p>Services in this category will appear here as they become available.</p><% if (path = marketplace_optional_page_path(:contact)) %><%= link_to "Talk to Lightek ↗", path, class: "lm-action secondary" %><% end %></div><% end %></div>
<% if (path = marketplace_optional_page_path(:contact)) %><div class="lm-banner"><div><p class="lm-eyebrow">LIGHTEK PRIVATE LABEL PARTNERS</p><h2>Your brand. Powered by Lightek.</h2><p>An independent platform, built around your business.</p></div><%= link_to "Explore private label ↗", path, class: "lm-action secondary" %></div><% end %>
